docs/phase-a-interview-prep.md

# Local tooling / scratch
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
scratch/

# Downloaded corpora (re-fetchable; 67 MB+)
data/

# graphify internals: machine-specific paths and regenerable cache
# (graph.json, graph.html and GRAPH_REPORT.md are kept)
graphify-out/.graphify_*
graphify-out/cache/

# Regenerable pipeline caches. Large, and invalid the moment the pipeline changes — the
# temperature-0 switch stranded a whole set of them. The PLAN cache is committed on purpose:
# the retrieval gate pins plans with it, so CI measures the change under test (ADR-22).
eval/results/pipeline-answers*.json
eval/results/gate-answers-*.json
